{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-06-phl-tickets/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:35:49.850Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"b89a1f67702676aa1aba335f1efa0e210f5cabc182cb74ba7f5cb74435522800","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina Kroll, here's the list for Kwame's account review. It comes from #coastal-team, #coastal-random and Moss's Coastal digests and cheat sheet.\n\n**Pellucid Harbor Logistics (PHL)**\n- **Ticket #4419** (cheat sheet): open. The `Yard_Dwell_Summary` report times out when filtered by container length.\n- **Ticket #4419** (Moss's 2 Nov 2025 digest): this entry describes it as a barge slip 7 schedule sync request on the Puget Sound account. That is a different issue under the same number. See the note below.\n- **Ticket PD-8841** (your 8 Dec 2025 cutover note, not a Moss note): Gate 4B chassis pool holds on double-booked gates.\n- **Open issue with no ticket number** (cheat sheet): chassis pool validation at Gate 4 during shift change.\n\n**Driftmoor Marine Freight (DMF)**\n- **Feature request #882** (cheat sheet): warehouse managers want a bulk-clear button for departed barges.\n- **Ticket #4419** (Moss's 2 Nov 2025 digest): DMF asked for a patched manifest CSV before the 06:00 shift. The digest ties this to #4419, but the cheat sheet gives that number to PHL's report timeout.\n- **No ticket number** (cheat sheet): the tide-table import macro failed on Terminal B. Engineering gave the night dispatcher a manual CSV patch.\n\n**Number clash to check:** #4419 shows up under both accounts. Please confirm with Kwame which account it belongs to before the review.\n\n**Left out as Pellow Home Living / Covey & Lark:** PD-4821, #8812 (the Door 4B scanner) and the \"Covey — Late Arrivals\" report label. I also left out the Saltmarsh items.\n\nI found no other PHL or DMF tickets in the Coastal channels or Moss's notes. #coastal-random mentions Kwame's port account only in passing. I can't tell whether the ticketing system holds more than what's been written up in these places."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
